    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introduction</strong></h2>H Girl Kemonomimi is a puzzle game. Players only need to swap the tiles to restore the picture. For players without patience, the game supports the cheat mode: one click to auto swap the puzzle. There is no time, score, or ranking limitation in the game. It is only for players' joy.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 5 characters, 50 high resolution original images, 200 undress phases (dressed-&gt;underwear-&gt;nude-&gt;????)<br></li><li> Kemonomimi<br></li><li> Jiggle physics. Choose how hard and how fast as you want<br></li><li> Relaxing music<br></li><li> Changeable background<br></li><li> Undo/Redo swapping<br></li><li> Auto swap<br></li><li> Zoom In/Out<br></li><li> Historical gallery<br></li><li> 50 achievements</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Jiggle Physics</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416120/extras/ebb8af34926f89e16757944d62817939.poster.avif?t=1709189775\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416120/extras/ebb8af34926f89e16757944d62817939.webm?t=1709189775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416120/extras/ebb8af34926f89e16757944d62817939.mp4?t=1709189775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416120/extras/6744af455a0d215a9bc8d82198598943.poster.avif?t=1709189775\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416120/extras/6744af455a0d215a9bc8d82198598943.webm?t=1709189775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite